    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired; low-grade temperature; no rigors</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Nausea, vomiting easing, watery diarrhea, mild cramps; no blood or black stool</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No aura, twitching, numbness, weakness, or confusion; mild headache only</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Passing less urine, dark</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Light-headed on standing; no chest pain or palpitations</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

